  MAY   25    1976

THIS DOCUMENTS CHANGES MADE IN THE SYSTEM AT HASSLE.

1)UPDATE,MOVE,KILLX,DUMP ADDED.
3)COMPARE AND MAP DEFAULT TO LPT.
4)DATE COMMAND:

	1)CHANGED TO STANDARD FORM  DAY/MONTH/YEAR.
	###THIS IS NOT IMPLEMENTED UNDER ETOS###

	2)ON DATE A FILE TODAY.TE IS WRITTEN
	DOING MUNG TODAY,C;TEST.FT

		A)DOES AN EBTEST.FT$Y$$
		B)INSERTS C^N     TODAYS DATE IN THE FILE.
		C)THE ^C IS OPTIONAL AND CAN BE LEFT OUT.
		D)IF ANY LINE IN THE FIRST PAGE HAS ^ AS ITS SECOND CHAR,
		  THE LINE IS REMOVED TO ALLOW FOR CHANGING DATE.

5)EXECUTE .LD GOES TO FRTS
7)DEFAULT FOR MAKE,TECO,MUNG TODAY  IS .FT
9)DEFAULT ALTMODE IN EXECUTE COMMAND REMOVED
10)DEFAULT ORDER IN EXECUTE IS:

	.LD
	.RL
	.FT
	.BA;.PA;.BN

11)DEFAULT FOR E.G. COMPILE ABC IS

	DSK:ABC<ABC

12)LOAD -T GOES TO MAP.
13)NOTE ETOS COMMANDS (TIME,CON,JOB).
14)FETCH, CONV COMMANDS ADDED TO ETOS.
15)EDIT, CREATE COMMANDS DELETED.
